1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,360
Good evening, everybody.

2
00:00:01,740 --> 00:00:05,400
I'd just like to say a few words before officially opening the exhibition.

3
00:00:05,920 --> 00:00:08,700
I'm very pleased to see so many faces here tonight.

4
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:13,280
It seems that many people share my interest in the history of the Old Town.

5
00:00:13,565 --> 00:00:15,240
And it is a fascinating history!

6
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:25,625
These documents, photographs, artworks, and other historical items vividly reflect the life of the Old Town, from its Roman beginnings until modern times.

7
00:00:26,060 --> 00:00:32,100
My special thanks to the local library and museum for all their work and also to our many private contributors.
